@startuml
' Source block: uml251_12_compatibility_notes (uml-2.5.1-legend.puml intake)
!include ../../../../tooling/styles/plantuml/structural/class-diagram-style.iuml
' ============================================================================
' Section 12 — UML 2.5.1 ↔ PlantUML compatibility summary
'
' Classification vocabulary is intentionally limited to:
' Native | Partial | Approximation | Unsupported
' ============================================================================

title UML 2.5.1 ↔ PlantUML Compatibility Notes
' Framework monochrome mode (replaces `skinparam monochrome true`).
UML_MONOCHROME()

rectangle "Standards-conscious mapping summary" as Summary

note right of Summary
  <b>Interpretation rule</b>

  UML defines the model concepts, semantics, and standard notation.
  PlantUML defines a textual rendering language.

  Similar glyphs do not automatically imply identical semantics.
  Where a first-class PlantUML construct is absent, this reference
  labels the result Partial, Approximation, or Unsupported rather
  than inventing renderer syntax.
end note

legend
  |= UML area |= Coverage in this reference |= PlantUML support |
  | General notation | names, visibility, constraints/notes, multiplicity, roles, qualifier | Partial |
  | Classes / classifiers | Class, abstract Class, Interface, Enumeration, DataType/Primitive/Signal labels | Native |
  | Associations | association, navigation, shared/composite aggregation, qualifier, AssociationClass | Native |
  | Dependencies / realizations | Dependency, Realization, InterfaceRealization | Native |
  | Instances | InstanceSpecification/object and slots | Native |
  | Packages | package, nesting, import, merge | Partial |
  | Profiles | Profile, Stereotype, metaclass, application, Extension mapping | Approximation |
  | Components | Component, Interface, Port, realization | Partial |
  | Composite structure | parts, assembly/delegation Connectors | Approximation |
  | Deployment | Node, Artifact, deployment, CommunicationPath, manifestation | Partial |
  | Use Cases | Actor, UseCase, boundary, include, extend, generalization | Native |
  | Activities | actions, control nodes, partitions, UML action shapes | Partial |
  | StateMachines | states, transitions, common Pseudostates, regions | Partial |
  | Sequence Interactions | lifelines, messages, activations, fragments, ref | Native |
  | Communication Diagrams | topology + numbered-message visual approximation | Approximation |
  | Timing Diagrams | timelines, values, messages, constraints | Native |
  | Interaction Overview | activity-style approximation of overview control flow | Approximation |
endlegend
@enduml
